{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 11152770581585475565,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Make None Callable",
      "source_hash": 2897053219957685353,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "None을 호출 가능 객체로 만들기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callable": "호출 가능 객체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 14249739146139807928,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "``None`` should be a callable object that when called with any arguments has no side effect and returns ``None``.",
      "source_hash": 3098416195755559272,
      "context_hash": 18159134531428656998,
      "translation": "``None``\\ 은 어떤 인자로 호출하더라도 부작용이 없고 ``None``\\ 을 반환하는 호출 가능 객체여야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callable": "호출 가능 객체"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BDFL Pronouncement",
      "source_hash": 11882048510722795025,
      "context_hash": 3695125015018126722,
      "translation": "BDFL 선언",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687102Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP is rejected.",
      "source_hash": 15770772961484205744,
      "context_hash": 5904331207065489247,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 거부되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687102Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is considered a feature that ``None`` raises an error when called.",
      "source_hash": 9443921035349171235,
      "context_hash": 12685212540148070030,
      "translation": "``None``\\ 을 호출하면 에러가 발생하는 것은 하나의 기능으로 여겨집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687102Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The proposal falls short in tests for obviousness, clarity, explicitness, and necessity.",
      "source_hash": 4001473127602431811,
      "context_hash": 15683261228803693062,
      "translation": "이 제안은 자명성, 명확성, 명시성, 필요성의 기준을 충족하지 못합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687102Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "The provided Switch example is nice but easily handled by a simple lambda definition.",
      "source_hash": 8264034186322784838,
      "context_hash": 16981318861736794663,
      "translation": "제시된 Switch 예제는 훌륭하지만 간단한 lambda 정의로도 쉽게 처리할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687103Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "See python-dev discussion on 17 June 2005 [1]_.",
      "source_hash": 7092537431607355916,
      "context_hash": 18405870291049051200,
      "translation": "2005년 6월 17일의 python-dev 토론을 참조하십시오 [1]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687103Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Motivation",
      "source_hash": 5845298202555182368,
      "context_hash": 4797638916501535832,
      "translation": "동기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687103Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To allow a programming style for selectable actions that is more in accordance with the minimalistic functional programming goals of the Python language.",
      "source_hash": 690970755948950062,
      "context_hash": 16219960584648717278,
      "translation": "선택 가능한 동작을 위한 프로그래밍 스타일을 Python 언어의 미니멀리즘적인 함수형 프로그래밍 목표에 더 부합하도록 허용하기 위함입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687103Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 2030221651512361646,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687103Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Allow the use of ``None`` in method tables as a universal no effect rather than either (1) checking a method table entry against ``None`` before calling, or (2) writing a local no effect method with arguments similar to other functions in the table.",
      "source_hash": 15332744835084949079,
      "context_hash": 3638375890498995892,
      "translation": "(1) 호출하기 전에 메서드 테이블 항목을 ``None``\\ 과 비교하여 검사하거나, (2) 테이블의 다른 함수와 비슷한 인자를 받는 아무 효과 없는 지역 메서드를 작성하는 대신, 메서드 테이블에서 ``None``\\ 을 범용적인 무효과 동작으로 사용할 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The semantics would be effectively",
      "source_hash": 2007860548821064852,
      "context_hash": 7344018980497414093,
      "translation": "의미는 사실상 다음과 같습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How To Use",
      "source_hash": 10118086214719771508,
      "context_hash": 8180654294428882912,
      "translation": "사용 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before, checking function table entry against ``None``",
      "source_hash": 18204370961889629016,
      "context_hash": 15538705362301529685,
      "translation": "이전: 함수 테이블 항목을 ``None``\\ 과 비교하여 검사하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Before, using a local no effect method",
      "source_hash": 11101740922835104664,
      "context_hash": 11848246527580913771,
      "translation": "이전: 아무 효과 없는 지역 메서드 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "After",
      "source_hash": 8983811925477012210,
      "context_hash": 8113179504067164326,
      "translation": "이후",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T04:25:26.687104Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
